{"title": "Beguiled (Condition)", "pageid": 30292, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Bugs", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Crowd Control Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Beguiled</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This creature has been charmed by <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> and cannot target him with attacks or spells. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CHARMED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCHARMED%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCHARMED%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This variant of Charmed lacks the proper <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed status group</a>, and as such will not be removed or prevented by typical means.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Beguiled\">Sources of Beguiled</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguiling Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiling_Rebuke\" title=\"Beguiling Rebuke\">Beguiling Rebuke</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>CHARMED</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Beguiled\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguiled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Beguiled</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature has been charmed by <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> and cannot target him with attacks or spells.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Charmed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charmed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot attack the spellcaster. The spellcaster has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> in dialogue.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Fiendish_Obeisance\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Obeisance_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Obeisance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Obeisance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Obeisance_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Obeisance (Condition)\">Fiendish Obeisance</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity must obey the commands of the fiend directly controlling it.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Spectator's_Charm\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator%27s_Charm_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectator's Charm (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator's Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator%27s_Charm_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectator's Charm (Condition)\">Spectator's Charm</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A feeble enchantment prevents this creature from attacking the spectator. Any damage could break it...</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211347\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2054/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27089/4194304 bytes